  <category name="Notation">
    <reapack name="reaper_native_notator.lua" type="script" desc="REAPER Notator 4.0.1: Native Musical Notation &amp; Engraving Suite">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[REAPER Notator 4.0.1 (Exclusive Edition) — Proprietary native musical notation, score editing, and engraving environment for Cockos REAPER. Requires ReaImGui v0.10+ and Reaticulate. Includes Master Acoustic Studio VST3 ('Notator Acoustic Master', supported on Windows x64 and macOS Universal2 only — Linux not supported). Copyright (C) 2026 A-intheCode. All Rights Reserved.]]></description>
        <link rel="website">https://github.com/A-intheCode/ReaperNotator</link>
      </metadata>
      <version name="4.0.1" author="A-intheCode" time="2026-11-28T11:23:01Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[
+ v4.0.1:
  - Stability updates, TAB right-click "String / Fret Assignment" menu, permanent global Smooth Line AA persistence & Synthesizer V Pro 2 fixes (automatic MIDI playback mute via Notator_SynthV_MIDI_Mute.jsfx, strict lyric/note overwrite & delete protection with confirmation dialog & 1-click Notes+Lyrics import — IMPORTANT: click 'Scripts -> Rescan' in Synthesizer V Studio Pro 2 after updating)
  - [v4.0] Critical Fix - Negative Delay scanning save error: unified data/articulation_delays.json storage (next to articulation_overlaps.json), automatic Self-Healing & Heal DB button, cross-instrument snapshot guard, Open Folder, 1-click Save Manual Offset to JSON & Bottom Bar Negative Delay Settings button
  - [v3.3.9] Interactive Percussion Drum Map: Piano Keys beside MIDI numbers, double-click yellow inline key rename (Tab/Shift+Tab), wider resizable sidebar (136-380 px) & centered multilingual Drum Map Manager (.txt Load/Save/Update/Rename/Delete)
  - [v3.3.8] Opt-in Score Validator & Live Note Collision Check/Prevention: right-side issue drawer, red overflow bar blocks (Canvas & Piano Roll), dynamics/hairpin checks, 1-click auto-fixes & pulsing red glow on blocking notes
  - [v3.3.7] Dynamics & Hairpins Multi-Selection, Group Move & Lossless Copy/Paste + Core Stability Fixes (Tempo Map sync, clean Slur/Unslur removal & resize-safe Hairpin clearance)
        ]]></changelog>
